# Digest-verified assets. The evaluation runner gates every reportable run on
# the byte digests of the model tree, the catalog and the public dataset. Git's
# autocrlf rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout under Windows, which changes those
# bytes and fails the gate before a single session runs. Mark these paths as
# non-text so the working tree matches the index exactly on every platform.
models/** -text
data/*.jsonl -text
